			<h3>104.二叉树的最大深度</h3>
			<a href="https://leetcode.cn/problems/maximum-depth-of-binary-tree/description/" class="link link-bold" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">104.二叉树的最大深度</a>
			<p>递归就好了</p>
			<pre><code class="language-cpp">
class Solution {
public:
    int maxDepth(TreeNode* root) {
        if(!root)return 0;
        return 1 + max(maxDepth(root -> left), maxDepth(root -> right));
    }
};
